# Kotlin & Compose

- Prefer immutable `data class` for state and models
- Use `sealed interface` for Route and AppResult variants
- Composables are stateless; collect `StateFlow` with lifecycle awareness
- Inject ViewModels with `hiltViewModel()`
- No hardcoded user-facing strings — use `strings.xml`
- Format money with `MoneyFormatter`, dates with `DateFormatter`
- Use theme tokens: `Spacing`, `AppShapes`, MaterialTheme colors
